/** \page page_test_coverage Test Coverage Report
 * \ingroup testing

From the repository root, build and run the tests and generate the coverage report and API documentation:
\verbatim
$ tests/coverage/make_coverage
$ make doc
\endverbatim
The coverage helper writes `doc/output/coverage/index.html`, which is embedded below.
`make coverage` alone only builds instrumented application binaries; it does not run tests or generate the HTML report.
The coverage helper saves test output through the runner described above. If tests fail, it still generates the coverage
report from their counters and then returns nonzero. An HTML report therefore does not imply that every test passed.

\htmlonly
<iframe
  title="MagAO-X test coverage report"
  src="../coverage/index.html"
  style="width: 100%; height: 85vh; border: 0;">
</iframe>
\endhtmlonly
 */

